OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys charged over Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been charged
OL,7,Fafter five teenagers were stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party in Hampshire.
OL,10,FPolice were called shortly after 22:30
OL,11,FGMT on Saturday to a home in Park Road
OL,12,Fin Chandler's Ford where an "unknown
OL,13,Fgroup" had gained entry to the event
OL,14,Fover a garden fence.
OL,16,FA 16-year-old from Southampton has been
OL,17,Fcharged with attempted murder. A second
OL,18,F16-year-old, also from Southampton, has
OL,19,Fbeen charged with wounding with intent.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
